      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "JACK SPRAT (3) is in good form. Led from wider and stuck on for second at his latest appearance at Melton, beaten 1.7 metres. Has the benefit of a low draw and will relish getting back to a circuit and distance where has won four of his five attempts. KEAYANG LAVITA (8) has been competitive since a fresh win at Terang and kept the ball rolling last time when she came from a big 60m handicap to get within 5 metres of the winner when third. Will enjoy a pretty soft run from this draw and she owns a good record at this circuit and distance. FREIGHT SHAKER (6) is in the mix following a fourth from the back row at his most recent appearance at Melton. ALDEBARAN SUSANNE (7) came from the second line last start to finish third at Melton and won the only time she attempted this circuit and distance. Last-start placegetter KEAYANG GYPSY (5) is proven at this shorter distance. Contender.",
